# Source artwork and design references. Kept out of git deliberately: it's ~225MB
# of full-resolution PNGs the app never loads — book covers are resized into
# src/assets/images/covers by scripts/buildStoryCovers.mjs, and the decorative
# pieces it uses are copied into src/assets/images/decor. Committing the
# originals would bloat every clone permanently, since git keeps them forever.
